  "description": "AurevonUI is a cross-platform .NET UI toolkit that renders its entire interface from SVG. Design in Affinity/Illustrator/Inkscape, wire it up with a tiny .aui overlay, and get strongly-typed controls, anchor-based layout, keyframe animation and live hot reload out of the box.",
